<p>The estimated <b>Price-to-Earnings (P/E) Ratio</b> for <b>Taiwan Stock Market</b> is <b>26.64</b>, calculated on <b>27 October 2026</b>.</p>

<p>Considering the last 5 years, an average P/E interval is [13.67 , 19.91].
  For this reason, the current P/E can be considered <font class="w3-padding-small pe-over-2 ">Expensive</font>
</p>

  <p>P/E Ratio is calculated on the <b>EWT</b> Etf, whose benchmark is the Taiwan Stock Market.</p>

